<li>Gibbon, Edward, The Decline And Fall Of The Roman Empire, "Chapter XI: Reign Of Claudius, Defeat Of The Goths. -- Part III."</li>
<li>The Lives of the Thirty Pretenders, at LacusCurtius</li>
